    78	## Two independent claim axes
    79	
    80	Never conflate mathematical evidence with workflow maturity.
    81	
    82	**Evidence tier** describes what the artifact proves, for example `EXACT`,
    83	`PROVED`, `MOD-p`, `BOOK-RELATIVE`, `FORMAL`, `INTERNAL-UNREVIEWED`, or
    84	`CONJECTURE`. Absence of a certificate means the lower tier. A computational
    85	header or model verdict never upgrades the underlying artifact.
    86	
    87	**Lifecycle state** describes scrutiny:
    88	
    89	`DRAFT -> PRODUCER-CHECKED -> PROVISIONAL -> PROMOTED`
    90	
    91	with exits to `QUARANTINED` or `REFUTED`. `PROVISIONAL` is not an evidence
    92	tier and must never be presented as promoted truth.
    93	
    94	A result may enter `PROVISIONAL` only when all of the following are recorded:
    95	
    96	1. an exact statement and scope, with failed or excluded stronger readings;
    97	   the ambient ring, quotient/localization/saturation order, and every
    98	   specialization must be literal. A conclusion moved between rings must
    99	   exhibit and audit the map; matching variable names are not a map;
   100	2. explicit dependencies and provenance;
