   102	4. producer-run attacks, sanity checks, and at least one meaningful negative
   103	   control where the object admits one;
   104	5. for a characteristic-`p`, Witt, or `p`-adic successor digit, the exact
   105	   integer numerator, its divisibility on the charged predecessor scheme, and
   106	   the reduced integer quotient are recorded before any reduction modulo `p`;
   107	6. no known contradiction with the current ledgers.
   108	7. **Completion handshake.** An author's hash or “ready” message is advisory
   109	   while that author is still running. The packet is frozen only after the
   110	   author is idle/completed and the coordinator independently verifies its
   111	   seal, replay in every declared mode, and unchanged pre/post hashes. No
   112	   reviewer, commit, or downstream consumer may charge preliminary bytes.
   113	8. **Transactional local publication.** New reports authored by local agents
   114	   or the coordinator use `ops/artifact_finalize.py` by default:
   115	   `begin -> close -> finalize -> verify`. Authors write only the leased
   116	   private partial; the tracked read-only manifest accompanies the final
   117	   report. Root verifies after author completion and runs `verify --staged`
   118	   on the explicitly staged report/manifest before commit. This supplements,
   119	   rather than replaces, replay and hostile mathematical review. Existing
   120	   external `ops/lane.sh` custody remains unchanged until a separate adapter
   121	   migration is reviewed; do not retrofit the transaction into a live lane.
   122	
   123	## Promotion and adversarial review
   124	
   125	1. **Different-model promotion.** No result enters `AUDIT.md` as promoted
   126	   until a different model has performed hostile review. Self-review and two
   127	   agents backed by the same producing model do not satisfy this rule.
   128	2. **Recompute, do not defer.** Review the exact source statement, hypotheses,
   129	   transcription, code, certificate, and conclusion as applicable. A second
   130	   prose opinion is not a computational review.
   131	   For a characteristic-`p`, Witt, or `p`-adic successor residual, independently
   132	   reconstruct the integer quotient and compare its generated rows with the
   133	   exact source identity on both a symbolic control and, where possible, an
   134	   old-pass/new-fail negative control. A mod-`p` bracket calculation alone does
   135	   not review a divided carry.
   136	3. **Priority by exposure.** Review priority is proportional to
   137	   `downstream fanout x centrality x fragility x rollback cost`. A claim that
   138	   many active lanes consume outranks an isolated lemma of equal apparent
   139	   importance.
   140	4. **Latency targets.** Start review as soon as a claim becomes provisional.
   141	   Aim to resolve high-fanout claims within six hours and ordinary claims by
   142	   the next full ideation round. A miss is review debt, recorded in `LIVE
   143	   STATE`; it is not silent permission to promote.
   144	5. **Immutable review inputs.**  Give every background reviewer a frozen,
