   152	   the portion actually checked. Corrections are appended promptly to
   153	   `notes.md`, the relevant canonical route/evidence file, and the current
   154	   daily digest.
   155	
   156	When the current reduction architecture is discussed, use the scoped names
   157	`G2-PSC` (global packet/sheet transport and fidelity) and `G2-BD`
   158	(post-residue-A bounded delay), never bare `G2`. The detailed dependency map
   159	is `ladder/REDUCTION.md`; summaries elsewhere must preserve its arrow
