   162	## Speculative parallelism and rollback
   163	
   164	Review runs in the background. Once a claim is provisional, cheap and
   165	reversible dependent exploration may begin under a visible speculative
   166	budget:
   167	
   168	- at most two child lanes and one unreviewed dependency generation per
   169	  provisional claim;
   170	- at most four active provisional roots campaign-wide;
   171	- normally no more than 25% of active research capacity may depend on any one
   172	  unreviewed claim;
   173	- enqueue hostile review before launching the first dependent child; a missed
   174	  review deadline freezes new descendants but not unrelated work;
   175	- cap each speculative child at six hours unless the coordinator records a
