   197	
   198	### Event triggers and micro-rounds
   199	
   200	Run an immediate strategy update when any of these occurs:
   201	
   202	- a decisive lane confirms, refutes, gaps, caps, or times out;
   203	- a new mathematical object, theorem, countermodel, certificate, or materially
