   462	  load-bearing check remains live in that mode. Freeze an AST scan showing no
   463	  `Assert` nodes in the verification paths (or prove that any remaining
   464	  asserts are non-gating diagnostics), and run a deliberate old-pass/new-fail
   465	  mutation under every claimed interpreter mode. Byte-identical positive
   466	  output alone is insufficient: stripped checks can print the same answer
