   114	  `C[x,y]^*=C^*`; hence `O(U)^*=C^*`.
   115	- Log-Kodaira monotonicity along `j` gives `bar-kappa(U)=-infinity`.
   116	- The Miyanishi--Sugie/global-extension mechanism supplies an `A1`-fibration
   117	  `rho:U->C`, with `C=A1` or `P1`, reduced fibres unions of affine lines, and
   118	
