   381	For a finite normalization `nu:A1->B`, the underlying affine curve is the
   382	topological quotient of the contractible normalization by its finite
   383	normalization fibres, and
   384	
   385	```text
   386	b1(B)=sum_z (#nu^(-1)(z)-1).                            (5.6)
   387	```
