   138	```
   139	
   140	Put `s=t+u` and `p=tu`.  The first equation gives `p=s^2+a`; substitution in
   141	the second gives (0.2).  The two endpoints of the resulting unordered pair
   142	are the roots of
   143	
   144	```text
   145	z^2-s*z+(s^2+a)=0,                                    (3.2)
   146	```
