+- Work in `M=C(X,S)` with `O(U)=C[X,X^-1,S] intersect O_(U,eta_Phi)` and
+  `nu(X)=mu`, `nu(S)=1-r`.
+- Let `K=C(F1,F2)`, `[M:K]=4`, and compute the minimal polynomial of `X` over
