+- Compare its discriminant/different divisor with the saturated boundary
+  packet: one `(3,1)` cusp, one `(2,2)` conductor, and the companion collision
+  divisor.
+- Use companion resultants to detect whether the monogenic index locus
+  `u^mu-v^mu=0` necessarily consumes an infinity-budget unit.
