+
+- The split DVR model realizes the local valuation and degree-four data, so no
+  one-valuation proof is admissible.
+- `A intersect M` is `O(U)`, not a polynomial ring.
+- Cancellations in the valuation intersection are essential; scalar weight
+  inequalities are not enough.
+
+Log-symplectic/compactification route:
+
+- Interpret `J_(X,S)(F1,F2)=c/(mu X)` as a logarithmic symplectic equation on
