+## 5. Special Focus: Surviving `m=1,T(3,4)`
+
+The core distinction is this:
+
+```text
+m=0: off-conductor critical point -> local C2 -> duplicate transposition
+m=1: T31 critical point -> local S3 -> overlapping transpositions allowed
+```
